logical_plan
01)Sort: t1.t1_id ASC NULLS LAST, t2.t2_id ASC NULLS LAST
02)--Inner Join:  Filter: CAST(t1.t1_id AS Int64) < CAST(t2.t2_id AS Int64) + Int64(1)
03)----SubqueryAlias: t1
04)------TableScan: join_t1 projection=[t1_id]
05)----SubqueryAlias: t2
06)------Projection: join_t2.t2_id
